{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>COMBOS ARE EVERYTHING </u></strong><br>The <strong>Combo Counter</strong> is the core mechanic of SMASHMAK \u2014 every strike you land builds it higher. Instead of just being a score, the counter directly <strong>unlocks skills, triggers abilities, and powers up your entire build</strong>. Without combos, your skills don\u2019t reach their full potential, making the counter the difference between surviving and completely dominating the battlefield.<strong><u> </u></strong><br><strong><u> </u></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014510/extras/33288778d6b9a75d42d96ef004c61201.poster.avif?t=1774834563\" width=630 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014510/extras/33288778d6b9a75d42d96ef004c61201.webm?t=1774834563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>COLLECT CARDS AND SKILLS</strong></u><br>The <strong>slot machine system</strong> makes every run unpredictable \u2014 you never know which skills you\u2019ll pull. That randomness forces you to <strong>adapt on the fly</strong>, mixing new abilities with your combo style instead of repeating the same build. The result? Every run feels unique, and sometimes the wildest random rolls create the <strong>most insane, one-of-a-kind moves</strong> you\u2019d never plan for.<br>  <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014510/extras/c7b5800bbca861035e22ae4a1702a6cd.poster.avif?t=1774834563\" width=630 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014510/extras/c7b5800bbca861035e22ae4a1702a6cd.webm?t=1774834563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>  <br><br><strong><u>DEFEAT YOUR OPPONENTS </u></strong> <br>In a brutal cyberpunk future, humans pit their most advanced robots against endless trials to see which design can survive. <strong>You are one of those robots \u2014 rebuilt after every failure, forced to spin the slot machine of skills, adapt your build, and prove you\u2019re the ultimate survivor.</strong><strong><u> </u></strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014510/extras/ae9e3a4c53a1980922c22e3fa637a545.poster.avif?t=1774834563\" width=630 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014510/extras/ae9e3a4c53a1980922c22e3fa637a545.webm?t=1774834563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014510/extras/56ee58f25c211e0520c2e5672bd7fe06.poster.avif?t=1774834563\" width=630 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014510/extras/56ee58f25c211e0520c2e5672bd7fe06.webm?t=1774834563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong><br>What About COOP?</strong></u><br>Right now, SMASHMAK is built as a pure single-player experience, but COOP is something I\u2019m seriously considering. If the demo does well, it\u2019s very likely that in the future you\u2019ll be able to chain insane combos together with a friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014510/extras/fe8e08554a98cb5acff41833802f65d4.poster.avif?t=1774834563\" width=630 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014510/extras/fe8e08554a98cb5acff41833802f65d4.webm?t=1774834563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4014510?t=1774834563","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014510/dbe08c2fe35ffdece532b7750ce4d48f488dd139/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774834563","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014510/863c578c2225f325bb0b4844f73102f7faf3622c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774834563","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014510/863c578c2225f325bb0b4844f73102f7faf3622c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774834563","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>COMBOS ARE EVERYTHING </u></strong><br>The <strong>Combo Counter</strong> is the core mechanic of SMASHMAK \u2014 every strike you land builds it higher. Instead of just being a score, the counter directly <strong>unlocks skills, triggers abilities, and powers up your entire build</strong>. Without combos, your skills don\u2019t reach their full potential, making the counter the difference between surviving and completely dominating the battlefield.<strong><u> </u></strong><br><strong><u> </u></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014510/extras/33288778d6b9a75d42d96ef004c61201.poster.avif?t=1774834563\" width=630 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014510/extras/33288778d6b9a75d42d96ef004c61201.webm?t=1774834563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>COLLECT CARDS AND SKILLS</strong></u><br>The <strong>slot machine system</strong> makes every run unpredictable \u2014 you never know which skills you\u2019ll pull. That randomness forces you to <strong>adapt on the fly</strong>, mixing new abilities with your combo style instead of repeating the same build. The result? Every run feels unique, and sometimes the wildest random rolls create the <strong>most insane, one-of-a-kind moves</strong> you\u2019d never plan for.<br>  <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014510/extras/c7b5800bbca861035e22ae4a1702a6cd.poster.avif?t=1774834563\" width=630 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014510/extras/c7b5800bbca861035e22ae4a1702a6cd.webm?t=1774834563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>  <br><br><strong><u>DEFEAT YOUR OPPONENTS </u></strong> <br>In a brutal cyberpunk future, humans pit their most advanced robots against endless trials to see which design can survive. <strong>You are one of those robots \u2014 rebuilt after every failure, forced to spin the slot machine of skills, adapt your build, and prove you\u2019re the ultimate survivor.</strong><strong><u> </u></strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014510/extras/ae9e3a4c53a1980922c22e3fa637a545.poster.avif?t=1774834563\" width=630 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014510/extras/ae9e3a4c53a1980922c22e3fa637a545.webm?t=1774834563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014510/extras/56ee58f25c211e0520c2e5672bd7fe06.poster.avif?t=1774834563\" width=630 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014510/extras/56ee58f25c211e0520c2e5672bd7fe06.webm?t=1774834563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong><br>What About COOP?</strong></u><br>Right now, SMASHMAK is built as a pure single-player experience, but COOP is something I\u2019m seriously considering. If the demo does well, it\u2019s very likely that in the future you\u2019ll be able to chain insane combos together with a friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014510/extras/fe8e08554a98cb5acff41833802f65d4.poster.avif?t=1774834563\" width=630 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014510/extras/fe8e08554a98cb5acff41833802f65d4.webm?t=1774834563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Max Emelyanov"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014510/38313a12c4298fd7825a59fa8f144621c4480474/header.jpg?t=1774834563","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"SMASHMAK","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 (64-bit)<br><